Subject: [PATCH 07/19] tests: Expect the physical size of a screen in its
 settings

KWin reports each screen's size in millimetres, and the page shows none of it. The
selected screen's size, with its diagonal in inches, should show when KWin knows it,
and nothing show when it does not.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
